371
00:19:44.391 --> 00:19:47.269
Mereka hanya besar.

372
00:19:47.936 --> 00:19:50.772
Orang Mongolia sangat kuat.

373
00:19:52.941 --> 00:19:56.153
Ia seperti orang Mongolia
