395
00:21:15.607 --> 00:21:17.526
Semua orang di Mongolia mengenali saya.

396
00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:21.530
Atlet judo

397
00:21:21.613 --> 00:21:23.657
-juga berlatih gusti Mongolia,
-Baiklah.

398
00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:25.575
dan orang Mongolia sangat kuat.

399
00:21:26.451 --> 00:21:29.621
Ahli gusti Mongolia
membuat cukup pintu masuk.

400
00:21:29.705 --> 00:21:31.081
Walau bagaimanapun,

401
